================================================================================
BUNDLED SELL PRICE DATA
================================================================================

Database/sellprices.lua is the vendor sell price column of pfUI's pfSellData
table, Vanilla 1.12 item data, reduced to the sell price only. pfUI is by Eric
Mauser (Shagu) and is distributed under the MIT License reproduced below. See
Database/CREDITS.md.

